// Playfield origin, in the game's 640x480 logical space.  Plain variables
// rather than immediates so they can be re-calibrated from outside.
//
// ★ These are in the SAME unit as the `shl eax,3` scale below: EIGHTHS of a
// logical unit (v0.5.15).  They were 186 / 44 (390 / 68 quarter-units) and
// MUST be doubled along with everything else in the transform -- see the
// warning in hint_px.
HINT_OXQ:
  dd 30C          // 780 eighth-units = 97.5 logical
HINT_OYQ:
  dd 88           // 136 eighth-units = 17 logical
